FULL-APP app_rw CRAWL (after the withTenant sweep + 0060/0061 policies)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ran every room on two live servers — one connected as the OWNER, one as the
real app_rw login role — and compared rendered <main> text length. RESULT: all
19 rooms render IDENTICAL length under both (owner == app_rw), e.g. pipeline
